    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 5 11]\ntheorem green_16 (N : ℕ) :\n    ∃ A : Finset ℕ, A ⊆ Icc 1 N ∧ SolutionFree A ∧\n      A.card = answer(sorry) ∧\n      MaximalFor (fun B => B ⊆ Icc 1 N ∧ SolutionFree B) Finset.card A",
